Hello <%= @recipient.first_name %>,

<% case @event_name %>
<% when "booking.requested" %>
<%= @actor&.first_name || "A passenger" %> has requested a seat on your ride.
<% if @ride %>

Route: <%= @ride_route %>
Departure: <%= @ride.departure_display %> (Philippine time)

Open the ride to review the request and accept or decline it.
<% end %>
<% when "booking.accepted" %>
Great news! Your seat request has been confirmed by the driver.
<% when "booking.canceled" %>
A booking on your ride has been canceled.
<% when "ride.canceled" %>
An upcoming ride you booked has been canceled by the driver.
<% when "route.alert" %>
A driver just published a matching ride for your route alert!
<% when "incident.resolved" %>
<% if @notification.incident_decision %>
<%= @notification.summary %>
<% else %>
A decision has been reached regarding your reported incident on Pasabaya.
<% end %>
<% else %>
You have a new update regarding your trip on Pasabaya.
<% end %>

<% if @notification.incident_decision %>
<%= @notification.incident_booking_restriction_summary %>
Open the update below to check whether a later decision has replaced it.

View the decision: <%= notification_url(@notification) %>
<% elsif @ride %>
<%= @event_name == "booking.requested" ? "Review seat request" : "Check the ride details here" %>: <%= ride_post_url(@ride) %>
<% else %>
Visit Pasabaya to check the latest updates: <%= root_url %>
<% end %>
